          "startDate": "2026-10-01T10:00:00.000Z",
          "description": "As a player, I want notifications and shared results to carry the correct competition and season context, so that I return to the intended match without receiving duplicate or unauthorized messages.\n\n**Acceptance Criteria**\n1  Result, reminder, unlock, goal, own-goal and red-card notifications include fixture, competition and season in their copy and links. Yellow-card notifications remain excluded.\n2  On job retry, a tenant, user, fixture, event and trigger key prevents duplicate delivery, and each tenant's settings are applied.\n3  Opening a deep link after authentication revalidates tenant access and the fixture. A plan change results in a safe unavailable message.\n4  Notification delivery across multiple competitions remains bounded and exposes backlog metrics. Never log authentication keys, tokens or sensitive data.\n\nRequired Changes  Update notification-job arguments, templates, the share resolver and deep links. Notification processing must not add provider calls. Preserve Banky/BAS authentication and queued friend synchronization.\n\nDependencies  BE05, BE06 and BE07.",
